@startuml Diagrama de Implantação — Sistema de Aluguel de Carros

skinparam backgroundColor #0A0A0A
skinparam nodeBackgroundColor #1C1C1C
skinparam nodeBorderColor #F59E0B
skinparam ArrowColor #F59E0B
skinparam defaultFontColor #F5F5F5
skinparam artifactBackgroundColor #222
skinparam artifactBorderColor #555

node "Máquina do Desenvolvedor / Servidor" as Host {

  node "Docker Engine" as Docker {

    node "Container: frontend\nImagem: nginx:alpine\nPorta: 5173 → 80" as FE {
      artifact "dist/ (React Build)" as ReactBuild
      artifact "nginx.conf" as NginxConf
    }

    node "Container: backend\nImagem: node:20-alpine\nPorta: 3001" as BE {
      artifact "dist/server.js" as Server
      artifact "Prisma Client" as PC
      artifact "prisma/migrations/" as Migrations
    }

    node "Container: db\nImagem: postgres:16-alpine\nPorta: 5432" as DB {
      database "PostgreSQL\n(Volume: pgdata)" as PG
    }
  }
}

node "Navegador do Usuário" as Browser {
  artifact "React SPA (JS/CSS)" as SPA
}

Browser --> FE   : HTTP :5173
FE       --> BE  : HTTP :3001 (REST API)
BE       --> DB  : TCP :5432
BE       ..> BE  : prisma migrate deploy\n(startup)

note right of FE
  Serve os arquivos estáticos
  do build React via Nginx.
  SPA fallback habilitado.
end note

note right of BE
  Node.js + Express + Prisma.
  Roda migrate automaticamente
  ao iniciar o container.
end note

note right of DB
  Dados persistidos em
  Docker Volume (pgdata).
  HealthCheck: pg_isready.
end note

@enduml
